WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.710
Chat keeps conversations in your pod, organised into rooms and direct messages.

2
00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:09.154
Start a room and give it a name.

3
00:00:09.154 --> 00:00:13.417
Here, Alice is making a space for weekend plans.

4
